@MichalStrehovsky found that [System.Reflection.Metadata doesn't handle generic attributes](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/issues/58073) and have fixed in https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/pull/57466 which needs unit tests added before merge

I have cherry picked his commits and added unit test (I could not contribute to the original PR, got permission denied), probably we want it within 7.0

Fixes: https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/issues/58073
